      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِيدٌ</span></b>  [originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِوْدٌ</span>, if belonging to this art.,]
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَادٌ</span></b> , <i>Measure;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدْرٌ</span>. (L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قيد</span>; and
